    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Exploration 1: Smart Cart Data\r\n\r\n**Inquiry Question**: How does an AI use pattern recognition based on public shopping data?\r\n\r\n1. Examine the list of 15 data points for the fictional student, Marina. Sort them into three categories: public, private, and sensitive\r\n2. Practice anonymizing private data to make it less specific and more general (\"Cass Tech Keychain\" > \"Keychain\").\r\n\r\n\r\n",
